  id: "S01-04", module: "C", topic: "An inelastic collision followed by a spring: two conservation laws in a row", diff: 3, rel: [["C", "Momentum is conserved in the collision, kinetic energy is not"], ["C", "The combined mass then converts kinetic energy into spring energy"], ["E", "Energy stored in a spring is half the stiffness times the square of the extension"], ["A", "Deciding which conservation law applies to which stage"]], key: ["momcons", "ke", "hookeslaw"], ans: 4, paper: "BANK-S01",
